234
00:12:06,425 --> 00:12:09,859
on before lunch. Here's the uncomfortable part. You

235
00:12:09,899 --> 00:12:13,089
cannot simply turn off thin slicing. It's not

236
00:12:13,199 --> 00:12:16,239
a character flaw. It's how human social cognition

237
00:12:16,259 --> 00:12:19,119
