246
00:12:43,639 --> 00:12:46,639
the moment before a decision that actually matters

247
00:12:46,999 --> 00:12:49,159
gets made on the strength of a feeling

248
00:12:49,168 --> 00:12:52,189
that arrived unusually fast. What you can

249
00:12:52,279 --> 00:12:55,659
do is treat the feeling itself as information

250
00:12:56,139 --> 00:12:58,749
rather than as a verdict. If a connection

251
00:12:58,779 --> 00:13:02,159
